          "range": "touch",
          "area": "",
          "targets": "1 willing living creature or 1 undead creature",
          "save": "",
          "description": "<p>Your hands become infused with vitality energy, healing a living creature or damaging an undead creature with a touch.</p>\n<p>If you use lay on hands on a willing living target, you restore 6 Hit Points; if the target is one of your allies, they also gain a +2 status bonus to AC for 1 round.</p>\n<p></p>\n<p>Against an undead target, you deal 1d6 damage and it must attempt a basic Fortitude save; if it fails, it also takes a -2 status penalty to AC for 1 round.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Heightened (+1)</strong> The amount of healing increases by 6, and the damage to an undead target increases by 1d6.</p>",
